\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The KAB framework: a brain-MRI case is evaluated as a five-phase causal chain (bottom), with three metrics attached to it (top and below) -- faithfulness (grounding + self-consistency), feedback-adaptation (a targeted re-query on failure), and soft gating (a phase counts only if its upstream dependencies were answered correctly).}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
